  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As a group owner I would like to be able to see users in my instances from the social menu regardless of their status (orange, green, blue) to be able to perform moderation capabilities. \n\nExample: X user is causing a disturbance and I am notified via discord or telegram. \n\nThis feature would allow group owners in other instances to moderate their active group instances if they have to leave temporarily or are running multiple instances.",
